 "intro": [
  "The Host comes back across the wastes in force, and the Concord's capital sends its last reserve: the Iron Margraves, warlord-knights on barded destriers, who have not ridden to war since the Sealing.",
  "The armies will meet on the river. Before they do, someone has to cut the Host's head off. Two war-leaders hold the wastes beyond the river: Gorrath Kiln at Ashfall and the witch-mother Sesk at Slagmoor.",
  "Aldous crosses with a handful. Find the Margraves' muster, then break both war-leaders' camps."
 ],
