   "text": [
    "The Host breaks and falls back to its pit. Cindermaw, the fortress on the lip of the Wound, is the last thing between the Concord and the gate.",
    "Somewhere behind the army, a witch who kept her word is walking free across the ash. Edda does not ask about it, and Aldous does not tell her."
   ]
